{"summary":"Subtle, inventive puzzles","description":"Dissembler is a subtle puzzle game about unraveling playful, abstract designs one color at a time.\n\nFlip pairs of tiles to make matching color groups vanish, but that is where the resemblance to a standard match-three ends. In Dissembler no tiles will drop in to replace the ones you’ve matched: your task is to remove all tiles and leave behind a clean slate. The experience starts simply, leading you gently from basic principles to more complex puzzles, but before long it will require careful planning and lateral thinking.\n\n■ Beautifully-presented minimalist puzzle game with chilled original soundtrack\n\n■ Every one of the 170+ puzzles is a hand-made work of art with no randomness\n\n■ Experiment freely – undo any number of moves at any time without any penalty\n\n■ Buy once and enjoy forever – no in-app purchases!\n\n■ Daily puzzles, plus step-by-step solutions revealed the next day\n\n■ Infinite mode offers an endless play mode with online leaderboard\n\n■ Color-blind mode makes Dissembler accessible to more players","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/F3VvCAxVRhY?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WySV2N7M-q4WcJHnBWqdS1dti3NXIBP3gCOw9eH1Ge6nyTLGKfMrh85TCqOrvh1lmNi6ShOfEQ0181OeoC3Tgw","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LaXll_pcliVujs82CPLBxye8uEtu-Iaca32-xPiPIUcW_Hu591rUEBGMPiEgMO4edRWhZV2O52eJ-7yXnX_Bqw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Xa0rNqllMNqdidK3WgyXcRpKivoDEij5QWZuEXu3Z3kI-ngdk8K1wdA-5DjdTCRHPy_N4YAjKzJlttrEWwugvw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OTQiX2vNJy4jB5cq3FcxcRkJunLwNu97LC05BieUddulo2Y3mLYeHtsGttEaCDf-RNafWfisQwkAsHjoLHXy","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/quzZSSwGmWbByzNsNYrHWgVDwPZD3zQPkwwLjjj33zJQ5GwxcyDaFJ4A2u0IjM1uBk_b7_oDrlgm1ypbqbA9-A","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YnFt05KayhAKxbMtX1w1FtVQL0D_aXa7Yv_-lYrMYMG17-L_H_G4S1Iq49CqfDyVYhDXKcl